#. module: account_payment_purchase
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_payment_purchase.field_purchase_order__supplier_partner_bank_id
msgid ""
"Select the bank account of your supplier on which your company should send "
"the payment. This field is copied from the partner and will be copied to the "
"supplier invoice."
msgstr ""
"Seleccione a conta bancaria do seu provedor á que a compañía debe enviar o "
"pago. Este campo cópiase do provedor se está enchido, e trasladarase á "
"factura de provedor."

